@startuml sequence_live_push
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Goal Metrics - Live SignalR push

actor User
participant "Activity Page" as AP
participant "API" as API
participant "Notifier" as N
participant "Hub" as H
participant "Tile" as T
participant "Controller" as C

User -> AP: Record activity for goal 17
AP -> API: POST /activity
API -> N: AchievementCreatedEvent
N -> H: emit goalProgressUpdated\n{ goalId:17, count:13 } to profile:{p}
H -> T: on('goalProgressUpdated')
T -> T: filter by goalId
T -> C: applyHubUpdate({ goalId:17, count:13 })
C --> T: count signal -> 13
T --> User: Ring redraws to 13/30 (no HTTP)

@enduml
